OL,3,GNEWSADog owner fined after man bitten
OL,4,Aon penis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog owner has been ordered to pay
OL,7,F#6,000 in kennelling costs and
OL,8,Fcompensation after her German Shepherd
OL,9,Fbit a man on his penis while he was
OL,10,Fwalking his dog.
OL,12,FRosemarie Grose, 67, was given a
OL,13,F12-month conditional discharge at
OL,14,FLincoln Crown Court after she admitted
OL,15,Fher dog called Bear was dangerously out
OL,16,Fof control on 30 July last year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
