OL,3,GNEWSADog owner fined after man bitten
OL,4,Aon penis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard the victim suffered a
OL,7,Fbite wound at the base of his penis and
OL,8,Fspent two days in hospital, later
OL,9,Frequiring at least 10 follow-up
OL,10,Fappointments and several medical
OL,11,Fprocedures.
OL,13,FGrose was ordered to pay #1,000
OL,14,Fcompensation and #5,000 in kennelling
OL,15,Fcosts.
